docs {
  `https://liveresultat.orientering.se/api.php` — what LiveOL calls today.

  Still live, which is what makes a field-by-field comparison against the new API
  possible. Change detection is `last_hash` in the query, answered with
  `status: "NOT MODIFIED"` and a fresh `hash` in the body.

  `getclassresults` is sent with `unformattedTimes=true`, as the server does today;
  drop it to see the formatted-string variant.
}
